    "Apple Personal Voice lets you record your voice while you still can, and recreate it on-device. EchoVoice speaks your phrases in that voice — so it always sounds like you. Everything is generated on this device and never uploaded.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Personal Voice lets you record your voice while you still can, and recreate it on-device. EchoVoice speaks your phrases in that voice — so it always sounds like you. Everything is generated on this device and never uploaded."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La voz personal de Apple te permite grabar tu voz mientras puedas y recrearla en el dispositivo. EchoVoice dice tus frases con esa voz para que suene como tú. Todo se genera en este dispositivo y nunca se sube a internet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
