    "Blink five times quickly, then close your eyes and hold for 2 seconds. Or rest on the red HELP button: it needs a longer look than other buttons, so it is not chosen by accident.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blink five times quickly, then close your eyes and hold for 2 seconds. Or rest on the red HELP button: it needs a longer look than other buttons, so it is not chosen by accident."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parpadea cinco veces rápido y luego cierra los ojos por 2 segundos. También puedes mirar el botón rojo AYUDA: requiere una mirada más larga para evitar activarlo sin querer."
