    "DISCLAIMER: EchoVoice is a personal voice journal, NOT a medical device. This report displays on-device acoustic measurements (speaking rate, pause duration, pitch stability) captured during repeat readings of one fixed reference sentence. Bring this summary to your Speech-Language Pathologist (SLP) to review trends.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DISCLAIMER: EchoVoice is a personal voice journal, NOT a medical device. This report displays on-device acoustic measurements (speaking rate, pause duration, pitch stability) captured during repeat readings of one fixed reference sentence. Bring this summary to your Speech-Language Pathologist (SLP) to review trends."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AVISO: EchoVoice es un diario personal de voz, NO un dispositivo médico. Este informe muestra medidas acústicas tomadas en el dispositivo (velocidad, pausas y estabilidad del tono) al leer la misma oración. Lleva este resumen a tu terapeuta del habla para revisar los cambios."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dark green-black background with bright text and controls.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
