          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch always works, and the HELP button is always on screen. For scanning instead of pointing, turn on iOS Switch Control (Settings › Accessibility › Switch Control): it steps through EchoVoice's buttons and selects with a switch, a tap anywhere, or a head turn.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch always works, and the HELP button is always on screen. For scanning instead of pointing, turn on iOS Switch Control (Settings › Accessibility › Switch Control): it steps through EchoVoice's buttons and selects with a switch, a tap anywhere, or a head turn."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siempre puedes tocar la pantalla y el botón AYUDA siempre está visible. Para recorrer los botones, activa Control por botón en iOS (Configuración › Accesibilidad › Control por botón). Puedes elegir con un botón, un toque en cualquier lugar o un giro de cabeza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch works here too. Turn on hands-free control in Settings to use gaze.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touch works here too. Turn on hands-free control in Settings to use gaze."
